    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. luau.py:364 symbol_registry.get(current_function), registry keyed by bare name, last file wins (luau.py:500, 513-515). a.luau and b.luau each with local function helper(): b's call comes out from a.luau's helper. WI-kosar fixed this family for tlaplus, zig, llvm_ir, agda and cobol, not luau. v10."  # 5a27
